### goapi - manual API test file
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
### or JetBrains' built-in HTTP client (IntelliJ/GoLand/WebStorm).
### Click "Send Request" above each block, top to bottom.
### Requests reference earlier responses by name, e.g. {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = jane@example.com
@password = supersecret123

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Readiness check (verifies DB connectivity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz


### =========================
### AUTH
### =========================

### Register a new user
# @name register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dele@yopmail.com",
  "password": "admin1234",
  "name": "Dele Doe"
}

### Login (use this if the user already exists)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dele@yopmail.com",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

### Refresh access token using the refresh token from login/register
# @name refresh
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiI0ODNlMzA5My00ZWNlLTRkMjgtYTg5MS00ZDJiZGMxMDQ5MmMiLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsInR5cCI6InJlZnJlc2giLCJpc3MiOiJnb2FwaSIsInN1YiI6IjQ4M2UzMDkzLTRlY2UtNGQyOC1hODkxLTRkMmJkYzEwNDkyYyIsImV4cCI6MTc5MDM1MDE4NSwiaWF0IjoxNzg5NzQ1Mzg1fQ.VbsR3CTNWxbyWitE0q19H2zEUHx9jO7-Xn2lroGANs0"
}


### =========================
### POSTS
### =========================

### Create a post (requires auth - uses access token from login above)
# @name createPost
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJjNjVhNmY5MC0zYjI0LTRjMzYtYTQ3OC1kZDQ2NjYzMGJlZGIiLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsInR5cCI6ImFjY2VzcyIsImlzcyI6ImdvYXBpIiwic3ViIjoiYzY1YTZmOTAtM2IyNC00YzM2LWE0NzgtZGQ0NjY2MzBiZWRiIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg5ODQwNzQ1LCJpYXQiOjE3ODk4Mzk4NDV9.NiMEv6US0MnGLnHC7b8RMUp3MZgMZX6Xx1XB9szYysY
Idempotency-Key: "1234556"

{
  "title": "My First Post yy",
  "content": "Hello from the client.http file!",
  "status": "published"
}

### List posts - defaults (page 1, page_size 20, newest first)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts

### List posts - pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?page=1&page_size=5

### List posts - filter by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?status=published

### List posts - filter by author
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?user_id={{login.response.body.$.user.id}}

### List posts - search by title (case-insensitive substring)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?search=first

### List posts - sort by title ascending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?sort_by=title&sort_dir=asc

### List posts - combined: filter + search + sort + pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?status=published&search=post&sort_by=created_at&sort_dir=desc&page=1&page_size=10

### Get a single post by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{createPost.response.body.$.id}}

### Update a post (requires auth, must be the owner)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{createPost.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "title": "My First Post (edited)",
  "status": "archived"
}

### Delete a post (requires auth, must be the owner)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{createPost.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}


### =========================
### ERROR CASES (useful for sanity-checking)
### =========================

### Create post without auth -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should fail"
}

### Register with a weak password -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "weak@example.com",
  "password": "short",
  "name": "Weak Password"
}

### Login with wrong password -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abayomiogunnusi@gmail.com",
  "password": "totally-wrong-password"
}

### List posts with invalid status filter -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?status=not-a-real-status

### Get a post that doesn't exist -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


