### Update profile - email only

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
"email": "abayomiogunnusi@gmail.com"
}

### Upload / update authenticated user's avatar

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/avatar
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJkNGViOTJjNy0xMzI1LTQxOGQtOTExNC1hYWIxODEzZDcwYmEiLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsInR5cCI6ImFjY2VzcyIsImlzcyI6ImdvYXBpIiwic3ViIjoiZDRlYjkyYzctMTMyNS00MThkLTkxMTQtYWFiMTgxM2Q3MGJhIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg5NzMwMzM1LCJpYXQiOjE3ODk3Mjk0MzV9.salS7dzge5S8b7g7Z_L28Z6_0SDNwcM313W4I_bI__g
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AvatarBoundary

--AvatarBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="me.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./testdata/me.jpg
--AvatarBoundary--

